  "description": "Application pursuant to Section 96A of the Town and Country Planning Act for non-material amendments to Reserved Matters Approval 21/2289/RMA dated 22/10/2021 (as amended by 22/5461/NMA dated 16/12/2022) for the Interim Transport Interchange T1 within the Phase 2 (South) (Thameslink Station Approach) sub-phase of planning permission F/04687/13 dated 23/07/2014 for the redevelopment of the Brent Cross Cricklewood regeneration area. The application proposes amendments to the wording of Condition 1 (Approved Plans), Condition 2 (Bus Stands and Shelters), Condition 4 (Taxi Rank), Condition 8 (Cycle Parking) and Condition 10 (Landscape Planting) to incorporate revised plan references that illustrate minor amendments to the kerb alignment, and adjustment to tree pit and cycle stand locations."
